# mēs. interjero dizaino studija — project context

Static Lithuanian interior-design studio website. No React, no bundler, no build step.

## Pages

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `index.html` | Home — hero with `mes.` + tilde over **e**, vision, portfolio preview, about |
| `paslaugos.html` | Services — 4 cards (Mini/Midi/Kūrybinis/Pilnas), pricelist |
| `portfolio.html` | 36-image grid + lightbox |
| `kontaktai.html` | Contact form (Formspree) + details |

Shared: `css/shared.css` (nav, footer, buttons). Page CSS: `css/home.css`, `paslaugos.css`, `portfolio.css`, `kontaktai.css`. JS: `js/site.js` (nav), page-specific scripts.

## Design

- Canvas **1440px** wide; content gutter `--pad-x: 109px`, `--pad-r: 107px`
- Font: **Montserrat** (Google Fonts)
- Colors: cream `#FFFBF4`, sand `#F6F1E7`, text `#11120D`, brown `#523F31`
- Heroes: full-bleed photos; page titles sit **below** hero on background (not overlapping photo)
- Service cards: large label (`svc-card__label`) + price only — no duplicate `h3` title inside body

## Images

- Site assets: `public/images/` and `public/images/portfolio/01.png`–`36.png`
- Never commit: `design.fig`, `public/images/_fig-originals/`, secrets

## Deploy workflow

1. Edit → save → preview locally: `python -m http.server 8080 --bind 127.0.0.1`
2. `git add .` → `git commit -m "..."` → `git push origin main`
3. **Netlify** (Gintarė's account) auto-deploys from GitHub — build command **empty**, publish **root**
4. Hard-refresh live site after deploy

Repo: `github.com/gintaregutauskaite/messtudija` (public). Human setup steps: `SETUP-GUIDE.md`. Site details: `SITE-NOTES.md`.

## When editing

- Match existing patterns; minimal diffs
- Keep copy in **Lithuanian**
- Contact email on site: `gintare@messduija.lt` — update all footers + kontaktai if changed
- Instagram: `@mes.studija` → `https://www.instagram.com/mes.studija/`
- Do not create git commits unless the user asks
